# --- infiniteinme.com -------------------------------------------------
# This domain used to be a Wix page whose whole body was a 900px iframe
# pointing back here, so the real content was unreachable below the hero
# and invisible to crawlers. It is now served directly, same as Soundways.
# Host-specific rules must come first: Netlify takes the first match, and
# the bare paths further down would otherwise win for both domains.
#
# 200 (rewrite, not 301) so the URL stays https://www.infiniteinme.com/
# while the content comes from infinite-in-me.html.
https://www.infiniteinme.com/             /infinite-in-me.html        200!
https://www.infiniteinme.com/robots.txt   /robots-infiniteinme.txt    200!
https://www.infiniteinme.com/sitemap.xml  /sitemap-infiniteinme.xml   200!
# Old direct link to the raw file -> canonical root, so the two URLs don't
# compete for the same content in search.
https://www.infiniteinme.com/infinite-in-me.html   /                  301!

/privacy             /privacy.html             200
/terms               /terms.html               200
/cancellation         /cancellation.html        200
/scope-of-practice    /scope-of-practice.html   200
/soundways-to-health.html    /    301
